Xanruʼ Dios?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Röʼë rinná bëʼë ga naʼ nayë́pisëtërëʼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ruzötaj cuinëʼ para uyúëʼ","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"le dë lúzxiba, en le dë luyú ni.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ruchisëʼ nupa nácagaca yechiʼ, rubéajëʼ léguequi lu bëchtö yu.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Ruchisëʼ nupa taʼyadzaj, rubéajëʼ léguequi lu dö bëbu.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Runëʼ ga taʼböʼlen nupa taʼnná bëʼ.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Taʼböʼlen nupa taʼnná beʼe bönachi queëʼ.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Runëʼ ga zóanu nigula huödx yuʼu lídxinu.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Rudzeja ládxiʼnu tuʼ runëʼ ga nacuáʼabiʼ zxíʼininu.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¡Guliʼcuʼë yöl-laʼ ba Xanruʼ!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/zar_tbl/PSA/113.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/zar_tbl/PSA/114.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/zar_tbl/PSA/112.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}